Follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for cold-start and validation lanes.

- Docs / config (non-policy) → `bun run validate:changed -- <path>` or `bun run audit:self`
- Plugin-wired policy YAML → `bun run validate:changed -- <path>` (runs full docs and owned-skill prose)
- Skill body → `bun run validate:changed -- <path>` (runs `audit skills`) or `bun run audit:skills`
- TypeScript → `bun test` + `bun run typecheck` + `bun run build`. `validate:changed` fails uncovered coverage-candidate paths
